flowchart LR
  U[User / المستخدم] --> W[Role-aware Workspace]
  W --> S[Server Authorization]
  S --> O[Organization Scope]
  O --> B[Branch Scope]
  B --> J[Jurisdiction Policy]
  J --> M{Module}
  M --> POS[ERP / POS / Tax Invoice]
  M --> RX[E-Prescription]
  M --> CAT[Catalog Review & Import]
  M --> CARE[Customer Care / Call Centre]
  M --> CON[Connector Readiness]
  POS --> A[Audit Evidence]
  RX --> A
  CAT --> A
  CARE --> A
  CON --> F[Fail-closed until formal evidence]
  A --> R[Reports / Review]
